# Turning Display starred items in Today view off from the settings window, while a Today pane shows a starred task, drops it from the list at once and keeps the setting after a restart.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Plan sprint @star
END
keys <C-w> s gt g,
see Settings
keys /
type in today
keys <Enter> <Space> <Esc>
hide Plan sprint  Work
restart
see 󰖙 Today
hide Plan sprint  Work
keys g2 x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Plan sprint @star
END
